{"t": 572022.3139, "dir": "send", "msg": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "textDocument/didOpen", "params": {"textDocument": {"uri": "file://temp/corpus_probe/SagerNet__sing-box__0d91c4547921__gopls-v0.23.0/adapter/certificate.go", "languageId": "go", "version": 1, "text": "package adapter\n\nimport (\n\t\"context\"\n\t\"crypto/x509\"\n\n\t\"github.com/sagernet/sing/service\"\n)\n\ntype CertificateStore interface {\n\tLifecycleService\n\tPool() *x509.CertPool\n\tExclusiveAnchors() bool\n}\n\nfunc RootPoolFromContext(ctx context.Context) *x509.CertPool {\n\tstore := service.FromContext[CertificateStore](ctx)\n\tif store == nil {\n\t\treturn nil\n\t}\n\treturn store.Pool()\n}\n"}}}}
